.el .ds Aq '
.TH sam-jail-updates 1 2026-11-28 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-updates \- Check whether newer versions are published (one app, or all). Contacts the update source each AppImage names (GitHub or its own server) and the servers it points to; no AppImage is downloaded and nothing is replaced
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail updates\fR [\fB\-\-if\-due\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIAPP\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check whether newer versions are published (one app, or all). Contacts the update source each AppImage names (GitHub or its own server) and the servers it points to; no AppImage is downloaded and nothing is replaced
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-if\-due\fR
Only if `updates.check_on_start` is on, and only apps not checked for a day (used by the window at start)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIAPP\fR]

